# Line endings are normalised to LF in the working tree, not just in the repo.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (set on this clone) rewrites every checked
# out file to CRLF while Prettier defaults to `endOfLine: "lf"` — so
# `npm run lint` reported a "Delete ␍" error on essentially every line of the
# frontend and was unusable. Committing this makes the checkout deterministic
# regardless of each developer's autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts genuinely need CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary: never translate, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.pkl binary
